  <section class="cell" id="q7">
    <div class="cell-label">EDA · Question 07</div>
    <h2 class="q"><span class="qmark">Q.</span> How are Apple's daily returns distributed?</h2>
    <p class="narrative">Engineers a daily percentage return feature and visualises its distribution shape.</p>
    <div class="code-card">
      <div class="bar"><span class="dot r"></span><span class="dot y"></span><span class="dot g"></span><span class="filename">daily_returns_distribution.py</span></div>
